@host = http://localhost:5144

### 1) Create a product → copy "id" from the response into @productId
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Telefon X", "price": 10000, "currency": "TRY", "initialStock": 5 }

###
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 2) Read it back
GET {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### 3) Place an order → copy "id" into @orderId
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 2 } ] }

###
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 4) Read the order
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### 400 — empty basket
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "items": [] }

### 422 — more than in stock
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 99 } ] }
